{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73c518a7a6f663bc41898fdca0e9be253f34f8ea86ee4af0737414a73734fc7",
      "text": "目标所在的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30866507365f9e71caa99cd953a8abd9de330a344ba35ac764e33b908cd2f360",
      "text": "翔真与九郎参加了315 Pro的试镜。\n意料之外的人物登场，\n两人虽感紧张，但依然迎接面试挑战。\n与此同时，桐生也为了成为偶像而拜访了事务所……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73c518a7a6f663bc41898fdca0e9be253f34f8ea86ee4af0737414a73734fc7",
      "text": "目标所在的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd23065e1691726599ca46cc1ac12ad804f32ce46c92ba33a38205a0cc894340",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君、贤，我回来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa1ebdccb067cabeba5fe10133e82922b7dcfd22799bedb98ad0fea0aa3f5d5",
      "text": "欢迎回来，社长！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:589d804748164c5241bbb6bb62dcfd62917736d775f572af86e0d3901e3fb23c",
      "text": "远行辛苦了！\n话说回来，这次回国还真突然呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:484d8fcbd96c955cbe050134c9cdd957bf2679dd015650e11cdac8d8ddcf2c75",
      "text": "工作比预定提前结束了。因为很挂心这边的情况\n就赶回来了。进展如何了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:407fc406e592c0c15d12a01bd0b20445ae8412cf48f4872c0637883ace52df0f",
      "text": "是！招募偶像的海报制作、在杂志上刊登试镜\n举办信息等，都在顺利进行中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18aaf967d60ec63e1164a20f1df471a0f69653d13dd8e7d81fdec1ac61fd6043",
      "text": "我这边也很顺利。正在向具有偶像光芒的人们\n搭话，并收到了答复。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c759ae50a202cd9368c4b59ebda1333a303235cfa86b33a4d50f9067dee6788",
      "text": "今天，事务所里正好有那些候选人的试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9af66865c356f0a503e7c9a7da4b5ac476baf62e71e98be127e690e6c7ff53c",
      "text": "要进行试镜吗。\n……唔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d98c9d80f51d72e5e2809996fd9c0881dc1c549e5ee7683683b353eed34d51",
      "text": "制作人君发掘的偶像候选人，\n究竟是怎样的人物，真想见一见啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff19c9c5c00e0e8cde6872457c1255435b058c294b2ab012c14572e6382fa330",
      "text": "能让我也参加试镜吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4be9e2b03e5e348434baa443953be926c9a55e36ee9af45c9f43551d0ecf46",
      "text": "务必拜托您了！我也很希望社长能看看\n那些候选人的光芒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f1761f8a37c4893c583a65d60bd3a4b259eaca7cc0235aff11185b00feba34",
      "text": "（虽说听说了除了我之外还有其他人\n来参加试镜……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dbe98074c83be1f3d52b559af98159e8c26270fd23f15e24bece0885011f006",
      "text": "（那不是之前出外景的时候，见过的孩子嘛。\n……是清澄家的少爷呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0440dad8166f6addc0dee2e652209694cd14ad90b69f0c123daf4a887c109ae0",
      "text": "（还记得我……应该不可能吧。\n只有一瞬间，而且当时人又那么多）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3d2df049b466af861f385bbf1e27cb96c77196ce8aa20ce5ffedcaf1982150",
      "text": "（当时我也这么觉得，真是个引人注目的存在啊。\n自带光彩呢。让人忍不住想看他）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d72c687eebef3ab93280402a566e580b77b634d9c9789b618841b549e3070d72",
      "text": "（那位制作人，还挺有眼光的嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68d966a8aa12073bf4c26217fa98af154d69a17d57e7803749fd3df8dee0b2d",
      "text": "（虽然看起来是个新成立的事务所，但照这架势，\n旗下的偶像水准应该会很高呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae3b4a79094bbdc623d666fe879f087c7d2f0b2e0338a09ea2fa419fa7ea709",
      "text": "（精神紧绷起来了！\n我也得拿出真本事才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad87be148f6ff2954611324f9fb8a46e508baf88ac9b4399b04f64c901538c7",
      "text": "（这位是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d677e783e663586d30fc484a9099c6f8f21635a780d7a417b0effce622d7d4cd",
      "text": "（不就是前几天祖父说的，因为门第出身\n而无法出演主角的那位吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60d34e9e494cb98782ee177549c36df54ace7ecfef32accfd970374a31ef836f",
      "text": "（即使在歌舞伎以外的舞台上大放异彩，\n那也是为了守护传统）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_b:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b463dd112f09dc50df92987334105d47297bf6399dc400f43f792b4406bfffbb",
      "text": "（祖父甚至还拿我上电视和杂志的事\n来作对比……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:189fedd65409321d81ca05b2694e5e8e7965c5c3f2ab2235f13da6c7312f6431",
      "text": "（没想到，已经在演艺圈大显身手的人，\n也会来参加偶像的试镜）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68449c91f3e9468bb9ffbc97958b9c988dfd5df7fc77d4f936a79e2541534814",
      "text": "（……比起只专注于茶道的人，\n事务所肯定更想要有经验的人吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ea9a309f03f793f3ef03c4aef04baa369a55b74320aca3e0a81d1f6b491a62",
      "text": "（不，即便如此，\n我也不能还没做就放弃）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7537b0003120cfc963962b62ec97b83c380c2180215fccef34f0bed700d4d5",
      "text": "（因为我要成为偶像，向更多的人\n传达茶道的魅力！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000056:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b9324da9724d89c047a31f72ae72fef8828c8650726bed047e47c71663caf56",
      "text": "让各位久等了。315 Production的\n试镜现在开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc1a35690048fd107ee29aaf021b0a0db70abe9a1196beb0353673f9efc37af7",
      "text": "在此之前，我们这边的评委增加了一位。\n社长，拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bd640a54171c519a376b3b11e7226d79ac65164868ef0c491b5806c58043a8f",
      "text": "我是斋藤孝司！听说有试镜，\n临时决定参加。请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d549bea60e83a7853859ecaec3cd15111129087427bfa8f1f80bfef76c80fd1",
      "text": "我们才要请您多关照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a341d756b634a988151527f0e88654f2e3c735de0f99f9a17e68bd6903e75d3",
      "text": "……请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc93e2424daa9a21a7a0b74ec0efe58d52ed0c22247136a476d1ea285cd021b4",
      "text": "那么，首先请进行自我介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2de80108f59e37fa0e9a84cc00a32a1339bbd53960db56a604f353852de7a2cb",
      "text": "接下来，能请清澄九郎先生先讲讲，\n作为偶像您能展现怎样的魅力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a958e6bc29230f14dbe2762fdcddd00ad9270bece6bb60e42f108d230af168f0",
      "text": "（根据之前制作人向我介绍的\n偶像活动，现在的我能做到的事……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87396086bd29f59661eb58414db5325e86567fdedd89e16fabbd3eca3894487e",
      "text": "好的。\n我打算通过茶道与广大群众展开交流。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ad210f04dea375c9740966e33588afc58a9d6cd876f9869f1c87e3432a890a",
      "text": "或许您会觉得，\n这与至今为止的活动有何不同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ae7a3599ee28d2d684e97ae45b51eed18d7f888aecf5f4ea83e87215f2fd76b",
      "text": "但是，我认为作为偶像能做的事，\n与作为茶道家能做的事是截然不同的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075789d526b69140a820a5c988e43d52e9846148e8b622205422a5ad39ad4c6a",
      "text": "茶道家点茶，恐怕并不能带来多少惊奇。\n但如果是偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e198df15ed752d985ec62802ff8cff07d32c387e5da7c048048e4dccc9bd5b",
      "text": "平时唱歌跳舞的偶像点茶并传达\n“侘寂”之美。那一定会留下极其深刻的印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b91a7e323731b7647b91c407fe99c0d58efc27a50a08f286fa0925610bc23563",
      "text": "清澄九郎先生，非常感谢。\n华村翔真先生觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab52849882e53e4779111e26529cce0885bd8d1b11df97b45f2da512594daf0",
      "text": "我嘛，就活用曾是歌舞伎演员这一点咯。\n话题度肯定是有的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d242f1212cc4ea8f05580240951c0df6056896491b194f7c3accaf2833a97f",
      "text": "而且，我在演艺圈既有经验也有知名度，\n关键时刻还有人脉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc04e53544fccb7d299dab822f3492f12966c4fb085f74d3982da87378bca1d",
      "text": "能作为即战力为事务所做出贡献哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56f2c02efbe4421657200645c00b0e02a6abf059261f932fc3b1a1b27119ff95",
      "text": "（用不用得上另当别论，\n我手里的筹码尽量先亮出来才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13bf96565b3b38ad88fb0712cc9fa38dd2b2952da46f8537991fbfe9e10863e",
      "text": "（为了能成为偶像，站在那里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:748cc81ee693cc25d92a9460f3ed5ededc83dece17edf9c523bb8d1c1813e2ec",
      "text": "（演艺界的经验……是我目前尚有所欠缺的\n部分。华村先生果然很厉害呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77699b029f2563cbb2da0a8b6c4b2a840faa20485dbcd74f1c623e121705fd2",
      "text": "我这边的问题就这些了。\n社长，您对两位有什么想提问的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41eee7890d27834ea20ba4f2a68f368a96cd9e25f9b6d48f9af48f3a5fdd0659",
      "text": "嗯。那么我也来问个问题吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:345751e6863e68615d1ed80faa5e3ad9a52751f7a2b06d3f86af6c164d67197f",
      "text": "你们两位，\n为什么会想要成为偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22f2df93845a3943232f3e4a88a4dd4eefa584dd563782e813b73aff0a54abb9",
      "text": "我是为了……成为偶像，以我自己的方式\n将茶道推广给更多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25432720663b03c24e14a8a920c5247ceac11fe02a9b07ca1363cd9b89f4ead4",
      "text": "坚守先辈的教诲，\n我也十分清楚这是我的本分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51246a5dd2529982c16fc2226c54c8d79d563a36927f9528a0a647626e95b09b",
      "text": "但是我，不仅想在门内敞开大门，\n更想亲自走出门去迎接众人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38301203c943e52d291ea6f326df6f6a0a2a83696d1d1c5257aed01c76e5a49d",
      "text": "（……不能只受茶道传统的束缚，\n还必须吸收新的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754d83bafdfdec4cb7b7a3b59a7bac429238b851a5f1bae60f6beb8b863685ca",
      "text": "以此为契机，我便想成为偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de06093f42019218666dce08bd1ff49e33570ed7a4778699aa404cdd60717c71",
      "text": "（是个认真思考茶道未来、踏实认真的孩子呢。\n……要在这个圈子里生存，未免太耿直了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d9614a89be04ad022f89d0f039a1b502452d05fbc1db147070a954dfd1704b1",
      "text": "（但是……是个让人很舒服的孩子呢。\n正因为率真，才值得信赖）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b3550244d5aed906424d270922f46fd6e855a7aded50169a548d2fa1800f1b",
      "text": "接下来，请华村翔真先生回答！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37b39647d44428ab3c5925138798762157e3649902994a188937adc0920709a8",
      "text": "我是因为想再次追寻\n学生时代看到过的那片景象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a021e45a0036316d6b629f01bf7051b4bb2131a0f36d6b71f17d0a88e62186",
      "text": "我是为了站在舞台正中心最耀眼的地方，\n才成为歌舞伎演员的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c540abb8447162e477713a64e6775a2d4d17d5984f19ff1ca98279f73e74b25",
      "text": "……因为一些契机，让我想起了这件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ad52088debc4e8be5276962b5d5db8f650b27c230179fddd0d2201464cbe98",
      "text": "正在那时，那边的●●●●プロデューサー酱\n对我说我有成为偶像的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5410794e68576ade4812aec0c79c6b30e01f564c836ec0bec27b909caa355e82",
      "text": "那句话恰到好处地，\n戳中了我的心坎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87514022b7fc5129640be3335a37ffa9b987372d177a082f2ba33b3b08e6c69a",
      "text": "还有呢，我也很中意制作人酱明明知道我是谁，\n还敢主动来搭话的气魄哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c7bddf8036747f8b07b50f6d2ccbd407d78cc6c667e103f2954b81fc676132",
      "text": "要再次发起挑战的话，就选这家事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62cf802542cda66161a115a027266618f24f6cb330800f4f1c24080fe9eaa8d0",
      "text": "只要能实现梦想，哪怕从底层摸爬滚打做起，\n我也乐意之至！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3001fe81913a9fbfa6378b53287d7eb83f7a164219c56fa7e79726ec7fee4d",
      "text": "（我自己也没资格说九郎酱呢，\n一口气全交代得这么坦白……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:283d0cfa45c16e8c18d740bcf9254c78a45576d9e283ee1ce5ec6d212ad1789a",
      "text": "（从底层摸爬滚打……华村先生也是带着觉悟\n想要成为偶像的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:966de1b5cfa1e272665051ce8ab5e02c6843c5cb48865c7d3c45af6772c5e326",
      "text": "PASSION！！你们两个都合格了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4db88d5f90f55c2a63359e86d4bc1f1dd6da56d0486e5fbc26c6d5c5d0e19566",
      "text": "我很期待你们偶像出道的\n那一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e310da3dc7b2bfaca63869ee2953704960114b108656bbe191fc06567035e4",
      "text": "恭喜两位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a955a2f8031e634c557aa3d926735e552a05180aed567c9c04eca5b435fba6",
      "text": "那么，制作人君！贤！\n剩下的就拜托你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554474fd0bcf2bfe062fc8966c856638d191d6e42e5346541d56a279e7d8ced6",
      "text": "好的，交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c905f994ac54b241f8e491fbac55c77709dba33cfd9e9395a45867ab282a4ea",
      "text": "那么，关于今后的流程，\n就由我来向两位说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9af09c7c605d242f05da51bbe9c5705eaebfbb5437d34b23c014513f863bced0",
      "text": "……咦，好像有人来了。不好意思，\n●●●●プロデューサー，能麻烦您来做说明吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd1c8293faff8253b25158cd4b0694d2907dde53e56a6a30321311bc95ef1333",
      "text": "包在我身上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b0a22637ecee016315b442e5cd8bb26fcd7f21b119a552fc44a485590ee653e",
      "text": "说合格了……不用展示实技考核吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de73581198ea992ac9732d946b963aff2523819ef99c7218c5d3aa165b47606b",
      "text": "是的。315 Pro单独举办的试镜\n有各种各样的形式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea05baa8e3fe9eb1d55c85502fd23a8592835c899d55c27b0c285072829117e2",
      "text": "像今天这样，\n社长一句话就合格的人也是有的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffb5a02d2afc210fef44fedf3c405a9ce89bd1ec65110b30f9bf2a60f8166984",
      "text": "这样啊……呵呵，真不可思议的事务所。\n不过，今后感觉会很有趣呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_g:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc70edf80e64e4a4ddb53ac1dec2bd428e4510e0b6b93933fe4b3592217a645f",
      "text": "是啊。\n重申一下……今后请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57435e1ed9e97502264f08d2528869e5fb9c4cd98772fe1080622031f43ce149",
      "text": "几分钟前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f148a044dbabd1a41cc8e847a99ab859a9387f3578d2471d8d856f04d2d9b905",
      "text": "315 Production……\n名字真有趣的事务所喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66a03bc87fe583b2f6edff29ea9bea827174f7ecacb98d38e63d2b0252871458",
      "text": "如果是这里，说不定能教我\n成为偶像的方法……去也！按门铃喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000049:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "几天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d5059a2a82562650a529056d8a3545e54d31825a4107cbbe2ff6e36db666bf",
      "text": "师父，刚才那段以偶像为题材的段子\n听起来怎么样喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb023f9ee964c3fea8d4c04a742e5ec3ffa372aaa67f8c0d375bbe4f6b9fe15d",
      "text": "差强人意。\n你自己也是这么觉得的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e78a5a857c3c59c946af90fcdc5a286a4cbec7a4e978dd8974640b9c08b27f9",
      "text": "无法反驳喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefda5437a208a0d120841de169d481084fa2b26705d34f5fe96295067ed96c9",
      "text": "……所谓偶像这个题材，光凭桐生你的\n想象、知识和经验是抓不住精髓的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b24ba93b58504e8fe8c7266987251f5ec9a6010712a50c05c98b746a272ca8cc",
      "text": "这种瓶颈任何人都会遇到。\n说明现在的你还驾驭不了这个题材。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d38e6d19edc335f105d6ff9df2e4c2abc7f07f6d4e67a548b05195516c6d8567",
      "text": "原来如此……也就是说既然经验不足，去补足\n不就好了喵！去补足当偶像的经验！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce719780b03e7a9ed745cbbe6ee7c58d329e1919f8d30c426ee1d0bfa06cc4b",
      "text": "原来打的是这个算盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2849e5f55a7bf9b47a5b8bc9eceb42d46a1498de6aed2e37d554e91060f62192",
      "text": "师父！吾辈要去当偶像喵！\n可以喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553c67af032d4e38292b0fa307f930c58faeac4d20b2ff0d65815a542b828832",
      "text": "随你便。不过，我可绝不会给你任何支持。\n凭你自己的本事去闯吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4df6d6071a067a320ba92d78f21932add808740e832b90573baf9f232935703",
      "text": "欢迎来到315 Production！\n……哎呀，你是？找我们有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34bca8e1b445ecac3cadf7ff1b7cc142496d541955c856fcebb1958d94e6f385",
      "text": "吾辈是来问问，\n怎样才能成为偶像喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e06ec25eb937ab9d108e899b5c6d8cd391cf0bf6466a9b30d3a56693cc695e",
      "text": "想成为偶像吗！\n既然如此，那就听听你的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28317f1e78703be97f0300459ba0ef1046f26e8495c968e68d3408cc0767d008",
      "text": "让您久等了……哎，社长！？\n接待客人的话就换我来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eae79a2ca1ebb972ada27d0122c15896e6de4dcdae75956688bbe9c6f103f943",
      "text": "嗯，交给你了。\n你，请进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91f58d92401784326fbfb396e1a37abf899c5433f260a4dcb30c7723773e0e41",
      "text": "（竟然是社长！？那肯定见过很多很多\n偶像了喵！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff9a9c58ee3e464383972dd013d066e9b58edec6d1d1ffc16d395a6ce8f9372",
      "text": "社长，吾辈有事想请教喵。\n怎样的人才能成为偶像喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:713a71f56b3f39c2ff227614d17a710ab1a3f8d00e270cfad56a57f204075ff6",
      "text": "是被●●●●プロデューサー君\n发掘出偶像光芒的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aef854aac710c9e3569255bae07a32c0da7fe578ceee250b7b49132a8710880",
      "text": "嚯嚯……！那个制作人君，\n吾辈真想见一见喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17fee52d176dde3f4a2dc084b34603400a276039718dc21c4cea0e2a5ce70dd5",
      "text": "今天他在吗喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9839db2a316961b4215b2c4a950a86c4c19ff5eaac1f38c8a541f02d15dd25d",
      "text": "制作人的话，\n就在那边的会议室哦。不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_i:cmd-000182:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf7b92ef7aa9dcdac8cca9348cfdbeaa376149d8fcf2c91e66b9d3ac0c7c880",
      "text": "会议室！\n那么，吾辈这就去打个招呼喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd39aadd9bacbc16a6da5215bf3cca604c631925c542bc431831fd613e149a6",
      "text": "打扰了喵！……喵喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ec2025a8b34231d14648878106fe2de674e85e23fe70f04660defe72730596",
      "text": "（噢噢，歌舞伎里见到的蝴蝶先生……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2876fecc8431d775887934d9bc27f9fdd1039a15994578b77f965fe113888705",
      "text": "（这位人士也让吾辈叮——地接收到了什么\n电波喵……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7fbd262a03e80105574b38b79aaf4539fc61b08d0867bddecaf29fb821e20b0",
      "text": "（现在当务之急是成为偶像喵！\n这么说来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74410a55489512b4ed621a39eed56dfb6b78ddaa15029ed74a7975b2c4d867c",
      "text": "咳咳。\n您就是制作人君喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:683fc79b62d832f47397312e0274d0ee747c9db4abb40f221eea3b7770aeb076",
      "text": "是、是的。\n您是落语家猫柳桐生先生……对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10817a2d0f6836e0d8b8772582cec98fca937a4cebe6c3fd211f8043a9334c0b",
      "text": "正是！吾辈有件事\n想问制作人君喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0039736f12f7ea8a5bc344882c4d9cf6456eb4e3c235ccfe57bc6a91d1ed6f56",
      "text": "话不多说！吾辈身上有“偶像的光芒”\n喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d4da947d6b2da0ef430443c98e47ab911d872a752c096e0fa6044356a7b7322",
      "text": "（光芒……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000135:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bb2cc1fcef195b31b2992cfa5cc20e1fb8af8a1314d7d05c14572f25baa4d64",
      "text": "有的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000135:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32a44aed6697b73a71c7e17861d8c2a3d9681cd94d80912ce3aaa819a8a9b450",
      "text": "（在电视上看到的时候，就被吸引住了。\n一直想看看他在偶像舞台上活跃的身影！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b91e5aeea40e2506f9fcff462ed667e8d70ac786a894d22f0259bd12406715",
      "text": "方便的话，您要不要来参加\n315 Production的试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d682b6c7f68b10a72a5ca9f16832f4b89808d590fe1760423b5dddfd1f07b89",
      "text": "喵什么！？\n当然！吾辈十分乐意接受喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_j:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1429e67621c66ac1cca99942af444822e86395285b039f8c288c8e547f33fd0",
      "text": "（喵呼呼，这样一来吾辈也\n拿到通往偶像的敲门砖了喵～！！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
